poor_link.description:
Only {rate}% of the requests to the VE.Bus device on {device} were answered in the last 5 minutes. Values can be missing or late, and commands can fail.

Check:
- the RJ45 cable between the MK3 and the Multi: firmly plugged in, not damaged, and not running alongside power cables;
- the USB connection of the MK3: try another port or a short USB extension, away from USB 3 ports and other sources of interference;
- whether other devices on the VE.Bus (a GX device, another MK3 or VictronConnect) are busy at the same time;
- a longer polling interval in the integration settings.

The *Link quality* and *Request timeouts* sensors show how the connection is doing. This message disappears by itself when the connection is good again.
